  "details": "Currently, in the \"Advanced Options\" menu when creating an instance, the four region buttons (USW, USE, EU, JP) are arranged in a single horizontal row. Because each button is narrow, they are difficult to read and easy to misclick when pointing with a VR controller. Since there is plenty of empty vertical space below the buttons in this window, arranging them in a 2x2 grid or a vertical list would allow for larger buttons and improve VR usability.",
